        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Main request path&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. User enters data in the React app.&lt;br&gt;2. FastAPI authenticates and validates the request.&lt;br&gt;3. The selected model returns a score.&lt;br&gt;4. The result is logged for monitoring.&lt;br&gt;5. Admins inspect summaries and drift." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontSize=13;fontColor=#334155;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
